/addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISAGAWA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAMBE, TAKAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KANAZAWA, HIDETOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAZAKI, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKUMA, JUNICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An air conditioner outdoor unit drive control unit (30) provided with an outdoor unit (2) having a signal line connection part (21) for receiving ON and OFF signals from a compressor, comprising an inverter device (32) supplying a power of variable frequency to the compressor (22) and a control device (33) to control the inverter device (32) so that the speed of the compressor (22) is raised gradually when the ON and OFF signals of the compressor received through the signal line connection part (21) are changed from OFF state to ON state, whereby the drive control unit (30) can provide an inverter system air conditioner by merely mounting an indoor unit of general heat pump system on the outdoor unit without modification to any part of the unit.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une unité (30) de commande d'entraînement d'un système de conditionnement d'air comprenant un dispositif (2) placé à l'extérieur. Ce dispositif comprend un organe (21) permettant le raccordement à une ligne de signal, et recevant des signaux MARCHE et ARRET en provenance d'un compresseur, un convertisseur (32) qui alimente le compresseur (22) avec un courant de fréquence variable et un système (33) de commande permettant de commander le convertisseur (32) de telle façon que la vitesse du compresseur (22) est augmentée progressivement lorsque les signaux MARCHE et ARRET du compresseur reçus via l'organe (21) de raccordement à ligne de signal passent de l'état ARRET à l'état MARCHE. Cette unité (30) de commande permet d'obtenir un système de conditionnement d'air à conversion par le simple montage du dispositif d'intérieur d'un système de pompe à chaleur courant sur le dispositif extérieur sans aucune modification d'un quelconque partie de cette unité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>